<div class="question">6. (Multiple Choice) Which matters more for actually learning the material?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> The tutor's personality (how it sounds).</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> The tutor's function (what it does, like quizzing or hinting).</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Neither matter.</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> The tutor's name.</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">7. (Scenario) You program an AI tutor to sound like a pirate (personality), but you forget to tell it to give hints instead of answers (function). What will happen when you ask it for help on a math problem?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
