<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> The tutor's role.</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Teaching rules (how it teaches).</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Integrity rules (what it must not do).</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Your bank account password.</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">11. (Classification) You write a custom instruction: "Never write my essays for me. If I ask you to write an essay, instead ask me for an outline." Is this a Teaching Rule or an Integrity Rule?</div>
