<div class="question">19. (Multiple Choice) Building an AI tutor is an ongoing process. This means:</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> A first version is not final. You test, notice problems, revise, and test again.</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> You build it once and never touch it again.</li>
